    "zh": "三相夜巡回收",
    "en": "Three-Phase Night Salvage"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "三台异步巡逻机 · 三件零件 · 最短安全路线",
    "en": "Three patrol cycles · Three parts · Shortest safe route"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐三件零件并停在东北出口。三台巡逻机分别每 8、10 和 6 回合重复一次。扫描数据列出了每台机器从第 0 回合开始的位置。移动和拾取各花 1 回合。在行动前或行动后与巡逻机同格都算失败。总共只有 43 回合。",
    "en": "Salvage all three parts and reach the northeast exit. The patrol cycles repeat every 8, 10, and 6 turns respectively. The scan table lists each bot’s position starting at turn zero. Moving or picking up uses one turn. Sharing a tile with any patrol before or after an action ends the run. You have 43 turns."
  },
